@startuml

title "Reset my password if I forget it"
actor Backoffice_User as User
participant "Front-End Form" as FE
participant "Back-End Service" as BE
participant "Microsoft Entra ID" as Entra
participant "Email Service" as Email

== Request Password Reset ==
User -> FE: Request password reset
FE -> BE: Send user email to request reset
BE -> Entra: Validate user email
Entra -> BE: Email validated, generate reset token
BE -> Email: Send password reset link to user email
Email -> User: Send password reset link (with expiration)

== User Clicks Reset Link ==
User -> Email: Open reset link
User -> FE: Access reset form
FE -> BE: Validate reset token
BE -> Entra: Verify token validity
Entra -> BE: Token valid
BE -> FE: Proceed to password reset form

== User Submits New Password ==
User -> FE: Submit new password
FE -> BE: Send new password
BE -> Entra: Validate password complexity
Entra -> BE: Password valid, update in directory
BE -> FE: Password updated successfully
FE -> User: Password reset success

@enduml

